# Cache policy for Cloudflare Workers static assets.
#
# Rules here must not overlap: when several match a request, Cloudflare *joins*
# duplicate headers with a comma instead of letting the more specific one win.
# `package_<hash>` is content-addressed, so it is the only thing safe to freeze —
# and the bundled fonts live inside it (see WasmCSS/Fonts.css), so they are already
# covered and must not get a second `/*.ttf` rule.
#
# Everything else is intentionally left to the Workers default,
# `Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate`, so a new deploy is picked up
# on the next visit rather than being pinned by a stale index.html.

/package_*
  Cache-Control: public, immutable, max-age=31536000
